OL,3,GNEWSAGrimsby shows 'creative energy' to
OL,4,ASir Phil Redmond
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrookside creator Sir Phil Redmond has
OL,7,Fspent the day in Grimsby after it was
OL,8,Fshortlisted to become the UK Town of
OL,9,FCulture in 2028.
OL,11,FRedmond, who was also behind Hollyoaks
OL,12,Fand Grange Hill, is one of the judges
OL,13,Fof the Town of Culture competition.
OL,15,FBid officials said he got a "snapshot
OL,16,Fof the creative energy" in the town
OL,17,Fwhen he was given a Viking welcome
OL,18,Foutside the Town Hall on Monday, before
OL,19,Fbeing taken to various sites including
OL,20,FGrimsby Docks, Horizon Youth Zone and
OL,21,FThe Hive.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
