OL,3,GNEWSAGrimsby shows 'creative energy' to
OL,4,ASir Phil Redmond
OL,5,
OL,6,FRedmond, who had never visited the town
OL,7,Fbefore, said: "It's not part of the
OL,8,Factual judging process. I just wanted
OL,9,Fto come [to Grimsby] and say thanks to
OL,10,Feverybody for taking part."
